@OrderService.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5002
@Identity_HostAddress = http://localhost:5001

### Identity: login to get token (reuse for Order smoke)
# @name login
POST {{Identity_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "gateway-smoke@example.com",
  "password": "P@ssw0rd123"
}

###

### Order direct — 401 without token
GET {{OrderService.API_HostAddress}}/api/orders
Accept: application/json

###

### Order direct — 201 create with Client token
POST {{OrderService.API_HostAddress}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}

{
  "cargoType": "General",
  "weightKg": 120.5,
  "volumeM3": 2.3,
  "origin": "Kyiv, UA",
  "destination": "Warsaw, PL",
  "description": "Direct Order Smoke",
  "declaredValue": 5000,
  "deadline": "2026-09-30T12:00:00Z"
}

###

# @name createdOrderDirect
### Order direct — list with token
GET {{OrderService.API_HostAddress}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}

###

### Order direct — get by id
GET {{OrderService.API_HostAddress}}/api/orders/{{createdOrderDirect.response.body.$[0].id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}

###

### Order direct — PUT status (Client cancel 5)
PUT {{OrderService.API_HostAddress}}/api/orders/{{createdOrderDirect.response.body.$[0].id}}/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}

{
  "newStatus": 5,
  "notes": "Direct cancel"
}

###
